  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gloom-sh/gloomberb/zipball/v0.17.5",
  "body": "## Highlights\n\n- **Chat keeps up with your typing.** Typing or attaching an image no longer redraws the whole conversation, so long channels stop stalling while you write. (#1845)\n- **Report a bug from the pane it happens in.** `Report a Bug` in any pane's menu pictures the pane, adds the app version, and posts it with your note to #bugs. (#1843)\n- **A Dock badge worth checking.** On the Mac it counts the people who wrote to you and mentions of you, not every unread channel message. (#1842)\n- **Quieter pane footers.** `[i] compose` and the sidebar `[<]` `[>]` hints are gone; the keys still work and the pane menu lists them. (#1827)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- `CTM` turns up for basis, carry and contango searches, `PERP` accepts names like bitcoin or brent, and the glossary explains basis and contango. (#1834)\n- Opening a crypto board row such as Zcash works again, and a failed open says why. (#1844)\n- BI Sector Performance shows every sector fund's price before the open. (#1841)\n- A panned dataset chart such as `CHOKE` stays loaded to its newest data. (#1846)\n- Index quotes say pre-market with the opening time, like stocks. (#1849)\n- `MDAY` counts a new CPI or jobs report day as soon as it is out. (#1850)\n- Missing currencies, open interest and Kelly payoffs stay blank instead of USD or zero, and `13F` lists funds sooner. (#1836, #1838, #1837, #1839)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.17.4...v0.17.5)\n"
}
